ow so  uh it was just one of those things where  i was kind of well wait a minute  let's let's have a chat and so i flew  down to florida to to meet with them  uh within a couple days and we just went  through that whole process vetting  process over the next 10 days to 14 days  to  make sure we we had everything in line  that we could get it done and and  obviously once we did  uh things started moving pretty quickly  so it was uh  great that uh you know obviously our  friendship  turned into a partnership uh with him  with the whole jordan brand sponsoring  me and michael jordan  but then you know turning it into a  nascar ownership now  uh is obviously historic and then did  you say you know who we should call  bubba wallace  there's there's no doubt from my mind i  i believe that boba's outperformed  um you know the equipment that he's had  week in week out  um there's been many times i've been  passed on research i'm like  i should not be running right here uh  and  and he's just uh he's getting the most  out of it so i think this is a great  opportunity for him  to return to the toyota family uh a  family that he's been with  early in his career as well and uh this  is an exciting partnership for everyone  i know i'm very excited about this bubba  but you've been with your old family for  a while when you got the call  was it something you had to think about  or was it an immediate yes for you  i definitely had to think about it um  and and i was actually at the shop  yesterday with the rpm family  uh talking to most of the guys in the  shop talking to my my a-team guys and  um you know it's still it's still tough  and you kind of  got to accept the fact that you know  things happen and things happen for a  reason  and i'm excited to move on but i kept  reinstating we still have two solid  races for us coming up here at  martinsville  in phoenix to close out the year that we  have to capitalize on so  as much as i'm ready for the future next  year my mind is s